# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# Flutter regenerates these for every platform folder on `flutter pub get`,
# and writes them with LF while core.autocrlf expects CRLF — so they showed up
# as modified on every pub get without a single character having changed. They
# are generated from the plugin list, so a fresh clone gets them back on the
# next `flutter pub get`; nothing is lost by not tracking them.
windows/flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.cc
windows/flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.h
windows/flutter/generated_plugins.cmake

